{"domain_cn":"代数","domain_en":"Algebra","branch_cn":"初等数论","topic_cn":"因数与倍数","cn":"因数与倍数","en":"Factor and Multiple","kind":"概念","definition":"若 a÷b=c（a、b、c 都是整数，b≠0），则 b、c 是 a 的因数，a 是 b、c 的倍数。","formulas":[],"example":"12÷3=4，所以 3 和 4 是 12 的因数，12 是 3 的倍数","level":1,"tags":["重要"],"prereq_names":["NEW:自然数"]},
